Let's see, you've got eight points right now.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:35.950
I've scored one, two, three, four...

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.470
Hey, what time is it right now?

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.510
Uh, it's about eleven.

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:46.530
Eleven, I see. So anyway, I've got twelve, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen–

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:48.280
Six. Six points.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.560
<i>It's a bold move to try and pull that. Too bold.</i>

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:52.780
<i>Pouting's not gonna help.</i>

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.550
Come on, let's go.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.930
Oh! That was out so it's my point, right?

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:06.300
<i>How is this girl lying with a straight face?</i>

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.260
Ready to call it?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:13.370
I guess I have to. I lost this time.

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:15.370
In that case, thanks for lunch.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:21.020
<i>H-Huh? Did I actually make Irohas cry?</i>

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:25.400
Huh? What? What's up?

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:28.640
I said you'd treat me if I won,

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:31.280
but I didn't say I'd treat you if <i>you</i> won!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.670
Indeed...

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:39.510
Well, I wasn't thinking I'd make you treat me in the first place, so it's all good.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.290
But isn't that kind of a swindle?

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:46.430
Isn't it like a girl to be a little bit underhanded?

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:51.280
It doesn't concern me, but that logic isn't going to make every guy give you a pass.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.520
No, no, no.

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:56.280
Of course there's no way I would do that around Hayama!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:58.310
What would I do if he started to hate me?

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:02.070
Well... I think Hayama would be happier to see that side of you.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.480
Is that for real?! Where is that information from?

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.170
No particular source.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.640
It's not credible if there's no source.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.190
I don't think I can act that way yet.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:15.270
There's no need to sweat over it.

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.060
For the time being he's...

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:21.580
That's why... for now...

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:28.210
I'll act this way only to you.

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.320
Hungry yet?

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:37.790
Hm? Yeah.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:41.220
It'd kick the date up a notch if you knew a good place to go eat!

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:49.330
Ramen? Really?

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:52.700
I mean, I eat here all the time, so...

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.870
Well, it is <i>you,</i> after all..

00:09:56.870 --> 00:10:00.330
And I did say I'd leave it to you, so I guess it's fine...

